# music-download-verify
owner: music-model-runner · cadence: after every music model download · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a loop that verifies your downloaded model files are complete before you try to run them?**

## Prompt
Inspect ~/Models/storage/music/ for ACE-Step1.5-MLX-4bit.safetensors and minimax-music3-mlx.tar. Check sizes against expected values. If a file is partial or corrupted, report exact path, expected size, and actual size.

## Evidence
> Beats folder is empty — the script failed before generating anything.
> Download MiniMax Music 3 (13GB) — we'll need to swap it in
> MiniMax Music 3 (mxfp8): 13 GB — won't fit alongside MTPLX
